></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303350/extras/f67afd5d596635e2bc2028ddc32bef35.avif?t=1748091270\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize your ship with unlockable cosmetics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play and unlock unique styles for your ship. With an increasing library of skins, there'll be a skin that suits everyone.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303350/extras/a4693cf81599319a04dfae31a3923933.avif?t=1748091270\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Systems are down and require time to repair, leaving you with a basic gunship with no hopes of escaping an aggressive asteroid event. Will you be able to survive the increasingly difficult 8 minutes to repair the ship's functions and escape?",
